eveloper logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Runwal Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRunwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032.\n\nRunwal Malabar is a luxury residential development by Runwal located in Malabar Hill, one of the most established premium residential neighbourhoods in Mumbai. The project has been planned as a low-density high-rise tower with only around 10 residences, which sets it apart from many newer luxury developments, where inventory is much higher.\n\nThe residences come in large-format 3, 5 BHK configurations, with layouts extending from 2400 Sq.Ft. to 4900 Sq.Ft.. The homes have private elevator access, full-floor style planning, panoramic sea views, and oversized deck areas connected to the living spaces. The project is currently in the New Launch stage, and the possession is expected around Jun 2032.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-project-large-image1-4430-opt-cd88b345-8986-4300-acd4-05348dd133fc.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4199-opt-91339d7a-1e18-4a94-b5f3-4e330f957f4a.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6023-opt-6896f3a8-0d12-4332-b2be-d58b8ad34456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹26.49 Cr - 60.00 Cr**\n\n₹1,16,400 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Runwal Malabar?\n\n## About Runwal Malabar, Malabar Hill by Runwal\n\nLuxury projects in South Mumbai are often sold through location alone. Malabar Hill already carries that premium positioning due to its limited inventory, sea-facing surroundings, and long-standing residential demand from high-net-worth buyers.\n\nRunwal Malabar, however, is not trying to function like a conventional luxury tower with a large number of apartments stacked across multiple floors. The project has been designed with only around 10 residences in total, creating a much more private residential setup compared to several newer ultra-luxury developments in Mumbai.\n\nThe project is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill and offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences. Apartment sizes range between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft.. One of the strongest parts of the project is the way the homes are planned around external openness. The project focuses on:\n\n* Arabian Sea views\n* Large deck-style balconies\n* Full-floor privacy concepts\n* Private elevator and parking access\n\nThat changes the overall residential experience because common-area crowding remains extremely limited. Another detail that stands out is the scale of the layouts themselves. Several residences have been designed more like private sky residences than standard apartment units.\n\nRunwal brings around 41 years of real estate experience and has delivered 148 developments across multiple markets.\n\nLuxury projects in South Mumbai are often sold through location alone. Malabar Hill already carries that premium positioning due to its limited inventory, sea-facing surroundings, and long-standing residential demand from high-net-worth buyers.\n\nRunwal Malabar, however, is not trying to function like a conventional luxury tower with a large number of apartments stacked across multiple floors. The project has been designed with only around 10 residences in total, creating a much more private residential setup compared to several newer ultra-luxury developments in Mumbai.\n\nThe project is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill and offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences. Apartment sizes range between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft.. One of the strongest parts of the project is the way the homes are planned around external openness. The project focuses on:\n\nArabian Sea views\n\nLarge deck-style balconies\n\nFull-floor privacy concepts\n\nPrivate elevator and parking access\n\nThat changes the overall residential experience because common-area crowding remains extremely limited. Another detail that stands out is the scale of the layouts themselves. Several residences have been designed more like private sky residences than standard apartment units.\n\nRunwal brings around 41 years of real estate experience and has delivered 148 developments across multiple markets.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Runwal Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  2400 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 26.49 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  4900 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 60.00 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRunwal Malabar's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Runwal Malabar | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 116400 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 98650 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 0 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRunwal Malabar avg. price is ₹ 1.2 L/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Lodha Seaview](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-seaview/100027/project \"Lodha Seaview\") | ₹ 1.16 L |\n| Current Project **Runwal Malabar** | ₹ 1.16 L |\n| [Runwal The Residence](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-the-residence/6610/project \"Runwal The Residence\") | ₹ 1.02 L |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| [JSW Echjay House](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jsw-echjay-house/325703/project \"JSW Echjay House\") | ₹ 70,800 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Runwal Malabar | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Runwal Malabar.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Runwal Malabar moved from ₹ 98,650/sqft to ₹ 116,400/sqft, reflecting a 17.99% rise.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Floor Plans\n\nThe layouts at Runwal Malabar do not follow compact high-rise apartment planning. The homes appear designed around openness, frontage, and uninterrupted external views. The project offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences ranging between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft..\n\nOne noticeable aspect of the layouts is the proportions of the living spaces. The larger layouts also appear planned to maximise outward-facing exposure to the sea, rather than limiting external openings to smaller balconies. Some of the key features include:\n\n* Large deck-connected living spaces\n* Private floor elevator and parking\n* Wider sea-facing frontage\n* Better separation between private and common sections\n* Full-floor style residential feel\n* Large-format luxury apartment layouts\n\nThe layouts seem clearly targeted at end-use luxury buyers rather than at investor-focused compact inventory.\n\nThe layouts at Runwal Malabar do not follow compact high-rise apartment planning. The homes appear designed around openness, frontage, and uninterrupted external views. The project offers 3, 5 BHK Flats residences ranging between 2400 Sq.Ft. and 4900 Sq.Ft..\n\nOne noticeable aspect of the layouts is the proportions of the living spaces. The larger layouts also appear planned to maximise outward-facing exposure to the sea, rather than limiting external openings to smaller balconies. Some of the key features include:\n\nLarge deck-connected living spaces\n\nPrivate floor elevator and parking\n\nWider sea-facing frontage\n\nBetter separation between private and common sections\n\nFull-floor style residential feel\n\nLarge-format luxury apartment layouts\n\nThe layouts seem clearly targeted at end-use luxury buyers rather than at investor-focused compact inventory.\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 2400 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Runwal Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 26.49 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 5 BHK 4900 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Runwal Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 60.00 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Runwal Malabar\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Runwal Malabar to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features1-4199-opt-91339d7a-1e18-4a94-b5f3-4e330f957f4a.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-amenities-features4-6023-opt-6896f3a8-0d12-4332-b2be-d58b8ad34456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Runwal Malabar Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload master plan of Runwal Malabar to explore layout details in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Runwal Malabar\n\nAmenities at Runwal Malabar appear designed around private luxury usage rather than oversized township-style infrastructure. Since the project itself has only around 10 residences, the common facilities are expected to remain comparatively less crowded during regular usage.\n\nHere are some of the key amenities offered:\n\n* Infinity-edge swimming pool\n* Double-height clubhouse\n* Private floor parking\n* Sky lounge spaces\n* Fitness centre\n* Landscaped leisure sections\n* Wellness spaces\n* Indoor recreation areas\n* Premium lobby infrastructure\n* Multi-layer security systems\n* 270° sky lounge views\n\nThe project also places strong emphasis on the arrival experience, private access, and sea-facing common spaces, rather than relying solely on indoor clubhouse infrastructure.\n\nAmenities at Runwal Malabar appear designed around private luxury usage rather than oversized township-style infrastructure. Since the project itself has only around 10 residences, the common facilities are expected to remain comparatively less crowded during regular usage.\n\nHere are some of the key amenities offered:\n\nInfinity-edge swimming pool\n\nDouble-height clubhouse\n\nPrivate floor parking\n\nSky lounge spaces\n\nFitness centre\n\nLandscaped leisure sections\n\nWellness spaces\n\nIndoor recreation areas\n\nPremium lobby infrastructure\n\nMulti-layer security systems\n\n270° sky lounge views\n\nThe project also places strong emphasis on the arrival experience, private access, and sea-facing common spaces, rather than relying solely on indoor clubhouse infrastructure.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Runwal Malabar Hill\n\nRunwal Malabar is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill, one of South Mumbai’s best-known premium residential neighbourhoods.\n\nUnlike several emerging luxury markets that still depend heavily on future infrastructure, Malabar Hill already functions as a mature urban residential zone with established social and commercial infrastructure nearby.\n\nThe project connects through Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road and allows travel towards:\n\n* Marine Drive\n* Pedder Road\n* Nariman Point\n* Breach Candy\n* South Mumbai business districts\n\nOne of the biggest advantages of this location is that residents continue to have central Mumbai connectivity while remaining in a comparatively quieter residential neighbourhood.\n\nNearby conveniences include:\n\n* **Schools:** Manav Mandir High School, NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Walsingham House School, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Sava Sadan Society School\n* **Supermarkets:**\n* **Banks:** Syndicate Bank, Sbi Bank, Standard Chartered Bank, ICICI Bank, Central Bankof India?\n\nThe surrounding area also includes premium hospitals, luxury retail stores, restaurants, and long-established residential infrastructure across South Mumbai.\n\nRunwal Malabar is located at Malabar Hill Mumbai in Malabar Hill, one of South Mumbai’s best-known premium residential neighbourhoods.\n\nUnlike several emerging luxury markets that still depend heavily on future infrastructure, Malabar Hill already functions as a mature urban residential zone with established social and commercial infrastructure nearby.\n\nThe project connects through Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road and allows travel towards:\n\nMarine Drive\n\nPedder Road\n\nNariman Point\n\nBreach Candy\n\nSouth Mumbai business districts\n\nOne of the biggest advantages of this location is that residents continue to have central Mumbai connectivity while remaining in a comparatively quieter residential neighbourhood.\n\nNearby conveniences include:\n\n**Schools:** Manav Mandir High School, NRP Sheth Multipurpose High School, Walsingham House School, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Sava Sadan Society School\n\n**Supermarkets:**\n\n**Banks:** Syndicate Bank, Sbi Bank, Standard Chartered Bank, ICICI Bank, Central Bankof India?\n\nThe surrounding area also includes premium hospitals, luxury retail stores, restaurants, and long-established residential infrastructure across South Mumbai.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Runwal Malabar.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Runwal Malabar](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/runwal-malabar-project-project-large-image1-4430-opt-cd88b345-8986-4300-acd4-05348dd133fc.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Manav Mandir High School\n\n#### Malbar Hill Post Office\n\n#### St Elizabeth Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Runwal Malabar\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\n* Carpet area details\n* Sea-facing unit positioning\n* Payment schedules\n* Tower approvals\n\nRunwal Malabar is registered under MahaRERA with registration number PR1170002502441. The project is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032. The launch took place around Feb 2026.\n\nBefore booking, buyers should still verify:\n\nCarpet area details\n\nSea-facing unit positioning\n\nPayment schedules\n\nTower approvals\n\n## How does Runwal Malabar compare with similar projects?\n\n![Runwal Malabar project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-malabar-project-flagship-opt-61db22c2-f776-4f06-8064-f7793ba0ee0b.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Runwal Malabar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-malabar/343428/project \"Runwal Malabar\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Runwal The Residence project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-the-residence-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Runwal The Residence](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/runwal-the-residence/6610/project \"Runwal The Residence\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Arkade Rise project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-arkade-rise-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Arkade Rise](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/arkade-rise/10869/project \"Arkade Rise\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Runwal Track Record\n\n![Runwal logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/runwal-538-4155.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nThe Runwal company was established in 1978. It is one of the top real estate developers based in Mumbai. With 20,000+ happy families and 51 real estate projects delivered, Runwal Developer operates in the residential, commercial and organised retail real estate space. The premier real estate developer takes the satisfaction of its customers as a top priority and delivers projects that are an apt combination of luxury and modern technology. Runwal Builders also manage the largest retail mall chain present in Mumbai. Currently, there are 14 ongoing real estate projects under the Runwal flagship. \nRunwal Builders holds several awards and accolades as a real estate company. Recently, it was granted ‘50 Best Real Estate and Infrastructure Companies. It also holds ‘The Star Realty - Lords of the Land award’, ‘The CNBC AWAAZ Real Estate Award’ and many other accolades. Over the years, Runwal has become a name that stands synonymous with service, quality, and on-time delivery while maintaining the highest quality standards. Runwal Group goes by 5 pillars of work ethics. These are:-\nPioneering future\nRespect for individuals & united as a team\nIntegrity\nDelighting the customers\nExcellence\n\n![Runwal Meadows residential project in Kanjurmarg East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-meadows-project-flagship-opt-645abb40-44ec-4ea9-807d-d0d0c3137680.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKanjurmarg East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Retail Shop, Apartment\n\n₹ 1.85 Cr to 4.79 Cr\n\n![Runwal Westwind Heights residential project in Khar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-westwind-heights-project-flagship-opt-3496be27-2bd1-434f-8a75-14d3c7b09cfb.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKhar West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Runwal Raaya residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-raaya-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n3, 4, 5, 6 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 11.30 Cr to 55.19 Cr\n\n![Runwal Avenue residential project in Kanjurmarg East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-avenue-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKanjurmarg East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.16 Cr to 4.00 Cr\n\n![Runwal Pinnacle residential project in Mulund West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-pinnacle-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMulund West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.39 Cr to 3.04 Cr\n\n![Runwal Timeless residential project in Wadala East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-runwal-timeless-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWadala East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.60 Cr to 3.50 Cr\n\n![Runwal 7 Mahalaxmi residential project in Mahalaxmi](https://static.squarey